            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa ŵacipundile cilambo cosope cene. Ŵapundile ayimwene ŵa cilambo ca ku matumbi, mwakutuluka mwa kungopoko lyuŵa, ni mwiŵanda mwa matumbi kungapilo lyuŵa, yalumo soni ni ŵele ŵa ku cilambo ca ku matumbi kum'mwela. Nginamlecela umi jwalijose; nambo ŵawuleje wosope ŵene. Yeleyi ni yiŵalamwile AMBUJE Mlungu jwa Aisalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa ŵapundile jemanjajo kutyocela ku Kadeshi Baneya kum'mwela mpaka ku Gasa ciŵandika ni kungulugulu nyasa, pamo ni mbali josope ja Gosheni, nipo mpaka ca kumpoto ku Gibiyoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa ŵapundile ayimwene wosopeŵa ni maupande gawo mu ndaŵi jimo ligongo AMBUJE, Mlungu jwa Aisalaeli, ŵaliji mkwaputila ngondo Aisalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panyuma pa yeleyi, Yoswa ni ŵa ngondo ŵakwe ŵawujile kuja ku cigono ku Giligala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.43"
            ]
          }
